  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "There is imposed a COVID-19 Health Recovery Levy on supplies made in the\ncountry, other than exempt goods or services, and on imports other than\nexempt imports. The Levy rate is One per cent and is calculated on the\nvalue of the taxable supply or imports. The COVID-19 Health Recovery\nLevy (Repeal) Act, 2025 (Act 1150, assent and gazette 10 December 2025)\nrepeals Act 1068 with savings for pre-repeal rights and liabilities, so\nthe levy's live window is 2021-03-31 to 2025-12-09 and the rate is nil\nfrom 2025-12-10 (encoded as a repeal version). GHAMOD GH_2025 correctly\nincludes the levy for its 2025 policy year.",
      "source_verification": {
        "corpus_citation_path": "gh/statute/act-1068/covid-19-health-recovery-levy-2021/section-1-imposition-of-levy"
      }
